    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "nora",
        "speaker": "Nora",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 127,
        "text": "We are making lunch for four people on Sunday. I want to prepare a bean dish with bread. Have we checked each ingredient?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "21bd41aab8921d8bfb30f9c4fc04f8ab52327de090c71a32c83f84b81b86bd22",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 133,
        "sourceEnd": 282,
        "text": "Yes. We have one potato, two tomatoes, a carrot, and a small onion. We also have garlic, oil, flour, and a little salt. The beans are already cooked.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "e2a38bc0bb1f4b1ef11fae6b1a5bcfff6bac49792db31b4c76ca1e76148b38e8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "nora",
        "speaker": "Nora",
        "sourceStart": 289,
        "sourceEnd": 370,
        "text": "Good. One guest cannot eat cheese, so let us keep it separate. Do we have pepper?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "6bd061bd63a4503ce9fb88d8077556098f8e36c71919b1b4f2e5387220769e6c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 376,
        "sourceEnd": 513,
        "text": "Only a little, but I found a mild spice in the cupboard. We can ask the guests before adding it. There is no sugar in the vegetable dish.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "9fe834da757e424f62205a34bd2389cbd08bdf438eeae2ce048442b394a39b14",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "nora",
        "speaker": "Nora",
        "sourceStart": 520,
        "sourceEnd": 601,
        "text": "I will peel the potato and chop the onion. Could you slice the carrot and tomato?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "6fa61de71c92bd520dd4c23ea28bf59a6db6332bc78553c2c278a483cda33c5a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 607,
        "sourceEnd": 746,
        "text": "Sure. First I will wash everything. Then I will put a little oil in the pan and fry the onion. You can stir it while I get the bread ready.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "0034ba8a3569e4abfc69cc70cc3dc9993d2587e0cb58a58c72041f3685b698d4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "nora",
        "speaker": "Nora",
        "sourceStart": 753,
        "sourceEnd": 796,
        "text": "Shall we boil the potato in a separate pot?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "59568a87c8d6cb5d23b77c28fbb80bd1f2a5fbdcb8bd49c342756174124108ba",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 802,
        "sourceEnd": 921,
        "text": "Yes. When it is soft, we can mix it with the beans and vegetables. Please pour the water away carefully after it cools.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "066b043ecbc90c239f29744dba960599feb0be7155a00dcbbcee3cf4f3d8c435",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "nora",
        "speaker": "Nora",
        "sourceStart": 928,
        "sourceEnd": 947,
        "text": "What will you bake?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "7b9c9bb91ef54c42cacdb441fa44ae21a23ffde2a3c8cd88cdbe3c4b6e5e1e4a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 953,
        "sourceEnd": 1065,
        "text": "A small loaf made with flour and water. The oven is already warm. I expect it to take about twenty-five minutes.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "4b17bcb18ab1e7f22d0cbc4b2abf6d06c19771cb6289eb214b94a3ea6b541137",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "nora",
        "speaker": "Nora",
        "sourceStart": 1072,
        "sourceEnd": 1184,
        "text": "That gives us time to taste the vegetables. If the flavor is too strong, we can offer plain bread with the meal.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "51de773fb234e6eb255e5599ec53f83156605413d259475aaabd6aaffa0c1a60",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 1190,
        "sourceEnd": 1308,
        "text": "Agreed. We will serve lunch at one o'clock, not at twelve. The guests said they would arrive after their morning walk.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "00b46669421f519d6d9e58a03849125ea6c2cdaed2b0c9c4ccda582382e7fd18",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "nora",
        "speaker": "Nora",
        "sourceStart": 1315,
        "sourceEnd": 1365,
        "text": "I will set four places while you finish the bread.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c6a8ab91fb59f78d625dd527abae36f613f12bb2f6d21bc929401724659aa940",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "eli",
        "speaker": "Eli",
        "sourceStart": 1371,
        "sourceEnd": 1490,
        "text": "Great. This is our fictional cooking plan; guests should tell us about their own food needs before we prepare the meal.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "e6c3dd7533abea2bc53563d245f6b90ffbbd58762db657687793bfe4daa1d024",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
